# Data-Driven CSV

- Keep all variable inputs in CSV files under `tests/data/` (e.g. `fr04-profile.csv`, `fr10-order-state.csv`, `fr18-order-admin.csv`).
- Each feature must have ≥12 data rows (positive + negative + edge all count).
- Specs must load rows via a shared helper (e.g. `tests/helpers/csv.ts`) — columns such as `tc_id`, inputs, `expected`, `type`.
- Forbid hardcoded inline arrays/objects as the **primary** dataset in specs.
- Prefer selecting cases from HW02 domain/BVA tables for FR-04 / FR-10 / FR-18, adapted for UI automation.
